{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MATCH APP! is a visual novel game based on a Japanese dating app. Players take on the role of the protagonist and experience a story of new encounters through the dating app.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, <strong>Masayan</strong>, is a university senior about to graduate. Encouraged by his friend <strong>Hiroshi</strong>, Masayan decides to dive into the world of dating apps. For the shy Masayan, everything is a first experience, and he's constantly confused... Will Masayan be able to &quot;match&quot; with a woman?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Masayan (CV: Ryutaro Ohno)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of the story. A university senior who has never had a proper romantic relationship during his college life. He starts using a matchmaking app at Hiroshi\u2019s suggestion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiroshi (CV:Uriela Cugui)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masayan\u2019s roommate and friend. One day, he recommends a dating app to Masayan and supports him in his romantic journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kumoko (CV: Kaede Takekawa)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman who matched with Masayan on the app. Although she doesn\u2019t have much dating experience, she takes a very proactive approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 1 hour-2 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Voice (Japanese Voice)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depictions of Criminal Acts:</strong> The story includes depictions of specific criminal acts such as theft and fraud, as well as related situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Violent Content:</strong> The game features violent situations and expressions, including physical altercations and fights.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Watchmen is watching you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3267520/0766f7e434c972f851fb8602c6e2f5efd95b374c.jpg"},{"name":"Let's koibana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3267520/fd54c1514c3740f1ceffb69762b59b9371663290.jpg"},{"name":"Freedom!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3267520/67d0c85c7b20f49d4d33d3699ff2c8deb31f4678.jpg"},{"name":"AS IT WAS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3267520/a17b58c70d94c29f665726201c4f6f29dd55532f.jpg"},{"name":"Are we all part of....","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3267520/41aa733a0f7d9dab7692dea41f54eaa1cd8d7f05.jpg"},{"name":"SIDE B","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3267520/e124dc90bb9d68a23a82c5b27609c076662750c7.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3267520?t=1755241232","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3267520?t=1755241232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267520/a2ca818ddfdbf05fdf745870ec605412a50e3319/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755241232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3267520/a2ca818ddfdbf05fdf745870ec605412a50e3319/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755241232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descrip